{"speciesId":228,"names":{"fr":"Malosse","es":"Houndour","en":"Houndour","ja":"デルビル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"To corner prey, they check each other's location using barks that only they can understand."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Around dawn, its ominous howl echoes through the area to announce that this is its territory."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HOUNDOUR hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HOUNDOUR hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"HOUNDOUR communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is simply unparalleled."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing prey."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing its prey."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est assez évolué pour chasser en meute et communiquer par des séries de cris modulés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est assez évolué pour chasser en meute et communiquer par des séries de cris modulés."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il hurle dès l’aube pour délimiter son territoire. On l’entend à des kilomètres à la ronde."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Al amanecer, resuena por la zona su inquietante aullido para anunciar que es su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Around dawn, its ominous howl echoes through the area to announce that this is its territory."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"夜明けごろ あたり一帯に 響きわたる 不気味な 遠ぼえで 自分たちの 縄張りを アピール。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pour traquer leur proie, ils se localisent mutuellement avec des aboiements compris par eux seuls."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para arrinconar a sus presas, comprueban sus posiciones con ladridos que solo ellos entienden."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"仲間だけで わかりあえる 鳴き声で お互いの 位置を 確かめながら 獲物を 追いつめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les Malosse chassent en meute organisée. Ils communiquent entre eux grâce à une série de petits cris pour encercler leur proie. L’étonnant travail d’équipe de ces Pokémon est sans comparaison."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Houndour sale a cazar con el resto de la manada con total coordinación. Estos Pokémon se comunican unos con otros usando una serie de aullidos para acorralar a su presa. El compañerismo que existe entre ellos es incomparable."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Houndour hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This Pokémon’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"様々な 鳴き声を 使いわけ 仲間と 連絡を 取りあい 獲物を 追い込んでいく。 チームワークの 見事さは ポケモン随一。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les Malosse chassent en meute organisée. Ils communiquent entre eux grâce à une série de petits cris pour encercler leur proie. L’étonnant travail d’équipe de ces Pokémon est sans comparaison."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Houndour sale a cazar con el resto de la manada con total coordinación. Estos Pokémon se comunican unos con otros usando una serie de aullidos para acorralar a su presa. El compañerismo que existe entre ellos es incomparable."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Houndour hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This Pokémon’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"様々な 鳴き声を 使いわけ 仲間と 連絡を 取りあい 獲物を 追い込んでいく。 チームワークの 見事さは ポケモン随一。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon est doué pour le travail en équipe. C’est un compagnon fidèle qui écoute les ordres de son Dresseur sans sourciller."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Famoso por su lealtad y ánimo cooperativo. Obedecerá sin dudar todo cuanto le ordene su Entrenador."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It cooperates with others skillfully. When it becomes your partner, it’s very loyal to you as its Trainer and will obey your orders."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"仲間との 連携が 得意。 パートナーに なると トレーナーの 命令に とっても 忠実だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si ses congénères et lui poussent de sinistres hurlements avant l’aube, c’est pour signaler leur présence à tout le monde."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los escalofriantes aullidos que profiere justo antes del alba son para señalar la presencia de su manada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"They make repeated eerie howls before dawn to call attention to their pack."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"夜明け前に 不気味な 遠吠えを 繰り返し 自分たちの 群れの 存在を アピール している。"}],"varieties":[{"id":228,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[3,"level-up",20],[4,"level-up",20],[5,"level-up",25],[6,"level-up",25],[7,"level-up",25],[8,"level-up",17],[9,"level-up",17],[10,"level-up",17],[11,"level-up",16],[12,"level-up",25],[13,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[23,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[3,"level-up",7],[3,"machine",0],[4,"level-up",7],[4,"machine",0],[5,"level-up",19],[5,"mach